Modifications in this repository

  LumaSR is a separate Android application built on top of the engine above.
  It replaces the original UI with Jetpack Compose and adds:

  - folder-first batch workflow (SAF tree selection, recursive scan,
    grid selection, predictable output folder)
  - Vulkan GPU and Qualcomm NPU backend switching with diagnostics
  - model comparison lab (multi-model timing and output comparison)
  - persistent per-stage performance logging
  - output index for resumable batch runs

  See the git history and docs/ for details.
